["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/import", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "An import provides an ExternalMap of an Element identifier that is used within a\ndocument but defined external to that document.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/domain", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A free-form text that describes the domain where the AI model contained in the\nAI software can be expected to operate successfully.\n\nExamples include computer vision, natural language processing, etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Custody refers to the responsibility, control, and safekeeping of an asset, person, or legal entity. It involves both physical possession and legal authority over something or someone.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
