["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/devLifecycleStage", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The development lifecycle stage specifies the phase or phases of a product\u2019s lifecycle to which a given requirement applies. These may include requirements that govern the design phase, guide development activities, define constraints for the build environment, provide instructions for the decommissioning phase, etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
