["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension/cdxPropValue", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A cdxPropValue is used in a CdxPropertyEntry name-value pair.\n\nUnlike key-value stores, properties in CdxPropertiesExtension support duplicate\nnames, each potentially having different values.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
