["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/additionText", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "An additionText contains the plain text of the LicenseAddition, without\ntemplating or other similar markup.\n\nUsers of the additionText for a License can apply the\nSPDX License List Matching Guidelines\nwhen comparing it to another text for matching purposes.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
