["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/plannedPrevious", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "This is the planned individual, business, or organization who was previously managing goods, services, or assets.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ismn", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "International Standard Music Number (ISMN) <https://ismn-international.org/ismn/the-ismn/> is a unique numeric identifier for printed music (notated music) standardized by ISO 10957 <https://www.iso.org/standard/83122.html>. It consists of either 10 characters (starting with the letter \"M\" for assignments prior to January 1, 2008) or 13 digits. A 13-digit ISMN is composed of four parts: the GS1 prefix 979-0, a registrant element, an item element, and a check digit. While elements may be divided by spaces or hyphens for human readability, these separators shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., 9790006538424).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/sbomType", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/securityAdvisory", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ReproduceAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Reproduction involves the act of replicating or reproducing a product. This includes producing new products related to husbandry, agriculture, and fishing.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each ReproduceAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasInput\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N1384f575b56b45878ea043b8bdb54cb6", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/autonomyType", "globalId", "", ""]
