["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType/scrapingScript", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Dataset provider is not making available the underlying data and the dataset shall be reassembled, typically using the provided script for scraping the data.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
