["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/percentile", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The percentile between 0 and 1 (0 and 100%) of the current probability score,\nthe proportion of all scored vulnerabilities with the same or a lower\nprobability score. The definition follows \"percentile\" in\nEPSS Data <https://www.first.org/epss/data_stats>.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
