["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/isoAutomationLevel", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The level of automation describes a spectrum of system capability, defining\nthe degree of control and decision-making authority a system possesses\nrelative to an external control.\n\nThis classification helps to define the roles and responsibilities of both the\nhuman operator and the automated system. It is a critical component for risk\nassessment, regulatory compliance, and user interface design.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/anonymizationMethodUsed", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Anonymization methods used.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/CreateProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The CreateProcess refers to the abstract process class that can be used to represent the process of creation of a product.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N6f2a3b7d36464077a796c8753e6c1028", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest", "_:Nef6e7207c1474ffd9bfd36cdc9736aef", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Artifact", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "An artifact is a distinct article or unit within the domain,\nsuch as an electronic file, a software package, a device or an element of data.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
