["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A ModifyProcess is a process that will result in the alteration of a product, such as a change to its configuration or its location.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasOutput\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.\n\nFor each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasInput\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N8a0b5461c470481e8186caae077cb948", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetPackage", "globalId", "", ""]
