["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetPackage", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A Package that contains data used for the operation, training,\ntesting, evaluation, or calibration of software, hardware, or systems,\nor for reporting, documentation, reference, and archival purposes.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
